We have a pair of DECstations and a VAXstation 3100 and a
VAXstation 3200.  The DECstations are (naturally) running Ultrix but
the VAXstations are running VMS.  We are thinking of getting two
units, one for the VMS side, one for the Ultrix puppies.  Ideally, the
backup device could be interchanged between the two systems so that if
one unit went down, the other could take its place.

